WEBVTT

00:12.913 --> 00:14.380
You must be sad.

00:17.150 --> 00:18.447
It must be hard.

00:19.719 --> 00:24.019
Not to be able to do anything other than just watch...

00:24.090 --> 00:27.890
The Kamui of the Dragons of Heaven will never truly awaken.

00:28.929 --> 00:31.489
If you hand your body over to me...

00:31.565 --> 00:34.159
...the Divine Sword's seal will be removed, too.

00:34.234 --> 00:38.193
And in due time, the future will come true as in your dreams.

00:39.239 --> 00:41.139
Now sleep.

00:47.180 --> 00:49.444
Soon, you will feel otherwise.

00:52.018 --> 00:55.920
Episode 22
Betrayal

00:57.691 --> 00:59.318
Go, Kazuki.

01:00.460 --> 01:02.052
Yes, Father.

01:14.274 --> 01:15.798
Where is that child going?

01:16.843 --> 01:20.438
To end everything as the Dragon of Heaven dreamseer saw.

01:21.481 --> 01:23.381
That was your wish, right?

01:24.517 --> 01:25.541
Yes...

01:25.619 --> 01:27.280
So it's all clear to you?

01:27.354 --> 01:29.083
Your wish will come true.

01:29.155 --> 01:31.589
As will your true wish, in time.

01:33.593 --> 01:36.653
And the Divine Sword's seals will be broken.

02:04.124 --> 02:05.250
Missie...

02:06.860 --> 02:08.953
Where in the world did you go?

02:20.106 --> 02:21.801
Karen...

02:21.875 --> 02:24.935
I'll come again after everything is over.

02:25.011 --> 02:27.536
And I'll introduce you to my family then.

02:35.155 --> 02:38.249
Kusanagi didn't show up again today...

02:38.325 --> 02:40.850
I want him to see you soon, too...

02:56.676 --> 02:59.008
The end is right before our eyes now.

02:59.079 --> 03:02.014
This is about the last time we'll see this scenery.

03:02.082 --> 03:03.049
Yeah...

03:04.551 --> 03:07.714
If you listen closely, you can hear the Earth screaming.

03:07.787 --> 03:09.812
You can see its tears...

03:09.889 --> 03:12.357
The world is wishing for a change...

03:12.425 --> 03:14.859
...and mankind must be annihilated.

03:15.895 --> 03:19.092
The sadness people feel is all superficial...

03:19.165 --> 03:22.692
...compared to the sadness the Earth is feeling right now.

03:22.769 --> 03:26.364
You must be feeling that more than anyone else.

03:26.439 --> 03:29.135
Because you are a Dragon of Earth, as well.

03:29.209 --> 03:31.473
Nataku headed over right away.

03:32.645 --> 03:35.944
I will see just what kind of a wish you have.

03:40.954 --> 03:42.114
Kamui...

03:42.188 --> 03:43.382
Can I go over there?

03:44.424 --> 03:45.391
Sure...

03:47.627 --> 03:50.596
I come here when I want to be alone, too.

03:51.865 --> 03:52.832
I see...

03:54.501 --> 03:56.332
It's a great view...

03:56.403 --> 03:58.268
The perfect scenery.

03:58.338 --> 04:00.203
It's the world we need to protect.

04:01.374 --> 04:02.500
That's right...

04:04.544 --> 04:05.602
What's wrong?

04:05.678 --> 04:06.940
Were you looking for me?

04:08.681 --> 04:10.171
Yeah.

04:10.250 --> 04:13.151
There's something I don't want anyone else to hear.

04:13.219 --> 04:14.345
What is it?

04:16.156 --> 04:18.283
Do you remember this?

04:18.358 --> 04:20.918
It's one of Princess Hinoto's spell sheets...

04:20.994 --> 04:23.895
It's the one that told us Hinoto's message in Ginza.

04:24.731 --> 04:25.698
Please wait!

04:26.699 --> 04:27.961
Princess...

04:28.034 --> 04:30.867
There will be an earthquake here in Ginza soon.

04:30.937 --> 04:32.905
A Dragon of Earth'll show up here, too?

04:32.972 --> 04:34.564
Please remain here...

04:34.641 --> 04:36.131
Protect Ginza.

04:40.413 --> 04:41.380
Damn it!

04:45.318 --> 04:46.945
Yeah, that's right.

04:47.020 --> 04:48.783
What's wrong with that?

04:48.855 --> 04:51.756
I've seen these same spell sheets many times before.

04:53.460 --> 04:57.760
The guys that attacked me the day I transferred to the school...

05:04.104 --> 05:07.073
The guys that followed Tokiko to Togakushi Shrine...

05:12.145 --> 05:14.204
The spell servants were serious.

05:14.280 --> 05:16.271
They really wanted to kill me.

05:16.349 --> 05:17.407
It can't be...

05:17.484 --> 05:19.315
The auras were the same.

05:19.385 --> 05:20.352
Hold on.

05:20.420 --> 05:24.049
That means your attacker was Princess Hinoto.

05:24.124 --> 05:25.489
I'm not sure.

05:25.558 --> 05:28.959
But Yuzuriha and Arashi were attacked in Inogashira.

05:29.028 --> 05:31.861
They stopped us and split up our forces?

05:31.931 --> 05:33.558
No, that can't be...

05:33.633 --> 05:34.998
It's strange.

05:35.068 --> 05:38.936
The aura I feel from this spell sheet and from visiting Hinoto...

05:39.005 --> 05:40.529
There's something different.

05:41.608 --> 05:45.704
The usual Hinoto is more like water or air...

05:45.778 --> 05:47.678
Very transparent and fragile.

05:48.715 --> 05:52.845
But the feeling from this spell sheet is heat, like fire or lava.

05:53.887 --> 05:55.047
Strong...

05:55.121 --> 05:56.884
Passionate...

05:56.956 --> 05:58.651
And evil?

05:58.725 --> 05:59.851
Yeah.

05:59.926 --> 06:02.053
You use that kind of spell sheet...

06:02.128 --> 06:05.928
...when you're serious about putting a curse on someone.

06:05.999 --> 06:08.490
Seeing the princess is the only way to be sure.

06:08.568 --> 06:10.468
It appears they're catching on.

06:10.537 --> 06:11.663
Oh, well.

06:11.738 --> 06:14.673
There's no time to do anything.

06:14.741 --> 06:16.470
He will come in due time.

06:17.510 --> 06:19.375
How will you explain...

06:19.445 --> 06:21.242
...what you have done?

06:23.283 --> 06:24.910
It's all right now.

06:26.386 --> 06:28.547
You've suffered enough.

06:29.856 --> 06:33.849
You only need to live on as a dreamseer from now on.

06:33.927 --> 06:36.191
Now hand everything over to me.

06:37.430 --> 06:40.160
I will grant you your wish.

06:41.167 --> 06:44.364
There is no more need to be sad, to be in pain.

06:47.240 --> 06:49.037
Sleep in peace.

06:49.108 --> 06:52.600
That is the way for you to live on as a dreamseer.

06:52.679 --> 06:53.805
Sleep...

06:55.081 --> 06:57.549
...and entrust your body to me.

07:01.721 --> 07:03.245
What's wrong, Inuki?

07:07.293 --> 07:09.227
You must be a Dragon of Heaven.

07:10.697 --> 07:11.925
A Dragon of Earth!

07:12.799 --> 07:14.664
I will defeat you.

07:14.734 --> 07:15.894
I won't let you!

07:24.978 --> 07:25.945
Yuzuriha!

07:29.415 --> 07:31.645
Yuzuriha's Barrier Field...

07:31.718 --> 07:33.117
Yeah...

07:33.186 --> 07:35.746
But it looks like they want to stop us again.

07:37.523 --> 07:41.721
Looks like what you said just before was on the mark.

07:49.902 --> 07:50.926
Oh, you too...

08:09.555 --> 08:10.681
Yuzuriha!

08:11.958 --> 08:13.687
A Dragon of Earth, correct?

08:14.560 --> 08:15.754
That's right.

08:15.828 --> 08:17.693
Though I'm not really into this.

08:19.465 --> 08:21.592
Then leave here without a word.

08:23.169 --> 08:24.500
I'll pass on that.

08:32.245 --> 08:35.544
Can you hear the Earth screaming?

08:37.083 --> 08:38.448
The Earth screaming?

08:39.952 --> 08:42.386
Humans pollute the air, rot the waters...

08:42.455 --> 08:45.185
...and have lived by cutting the Earth apart.

08:45.258 --> 08:46.691
Am I wrong?

08:46.759 --> 08:49.421
It's true they've gone too far in some areas...

08:49.495 --> 08:51.520
...but I want to believe in humans!

08:52.565 --> 08:55.193
Humans are the type that never realize...

08:55.268 --> 08:58.066
...that they're choking their own necks by doing this.

09:01.140 --> 09:05.474
I don't think you're wrong about that...

09:05.545 --> 09:09.606
But all sorts of lives are born and disappear on this Earth.

09:09.682 --> 09:13.880
Only humans can grieve the deaths of other living things.

09:14.754 --> 09:18.053
I think that is arrogant of humans to say.

09:18.124 --> 09:19.523
Perhaps you're right...

09:20.727 --> 09:22.490
But I believe.

09:22.562 --> 09:23.529
In mankind.

09:33.106 --> 09:35.631
I'd like to believe in them, too...

09:37.110 --> 09:38.407
But you know...

09:45.084 --> 09:47.746
Damn it, there's no end to this.

09:49.155 --> 09:50.588
W-What is this?

09:52.625 --> 09:53.592
Kamui!

10:17.216 --> 10:19.480
It's been quite a while.

10:19.552 --> 10:22.214
I'm finally able to step inside your dream.

10:23.389 --> 10:24.356
How are you?

10:25.391 --> 10:29.760
How do you feel about your dreams slowly becoming reality?

10:33.032 --> 10:33.999
I...

10:35.001 --> 10:36.161
I have...

10:37.203 --> 10:40.172
...given up on all hope.

10:41.207 --> 10:42.674
You've lost all hope?

10:43.776 --> 10:47.610
There is no way that my dreams prove otherwise.

10:49.182 --> 10:51.309
The Dragons of Heaven will die...

10:51.384 --> 10:53.409
...and the Dragons of Earth will win.

10:58.724 --> 11:01.090
It serves you right, my sister.

11:01.160 --> 11:03.219
Though we were born sisters...

11:03.296 --> 11:05.958
...you were the one everyone took good care of...

11:06.032 --> 11:08.933
...because you had the power to see things in dreams.

11:09.001 --> 11:11.367
I didn't have such powers...

11:11.437 --> 11:14.998
...and I was always abused and treated as a nuisance.

11:15.074 --> 11:16.405
I hate you.

11:17.443 --> 11:21.743
The more you suffer, the more fulfilled I feel.

11:22.915 --> 11:24.143
Kanoe...

11:24.217 --> 11:28.381
I gathered the Dragons of Earth and turned your dream to reality...

11:28.454 --> 11:30.479
...so that I could torture you.

11:32.058 --> 11:34.219
But I'd like you to thank me.

11:34.293 --> 11:39.390
Because of me, you can live on as a dreamseer.

11:39.465 --> 11:42.093
After all, if you can't see your dreams...

11:42.168 --> 11:44.466
...there's no reason for you to exist.

11:45.605 --> 11:49.041
Soon, you will see a future like the one in your dreams.

11:49.108 --> 11:52.043
And you can writhe about in pain and grieve.

11:52.111 --> 11:55.603
I'm really looking forward to seeing you like that.

12:03.956 --> 12:09.019
So you are the one aiding me in granting my wish...

12:09.095 --> 12:12.462
So that I can live on as a dreamseer...

12:47.133 --> 12:48.327
Kusanagi...

12:49.335 --> 12:52.532
It's you, isn't it, Kusanagi?

12:55.808 --> 12:58.106
That's right, little lady.

13:00.146 --> 13:02.137
Kusanagi...

13:02.214 --> 13:04.614
So you were a Dragon of Earth after all.

13:05.952 --> 13:06.941
After all?

13:08.454 --> 13:11.150
I felt it from the first time I met you...

13:12.158 --> 13:14.626
But I was still fine with it.

13:18.698 --> 13:21.132
Even if you were a Dragon of Earth...

13:21.200 --> 13:23.134
...you treated Inuki nicely.

13:24.604 --> 13:25.969
And because you were kind...

13:30.109 --> 13:34.443
Even if you were a Dragon of Earth, Kusanagi...

13:34.513 --> 13:36.174
...I wanted to protect you.

13:37.216 --> 13:40.208
I love you.

13:42.288 --> 13:45.519
You don't have ill will towards me at all?

13:46.559 --> 13:49.528
I'm a Dragon of Earth who wants to destroy the world.

13:49.595 --> 13:50.721
Not at all!

13:52.031 --> 13:55.831
Because that's the destiny you yourself chose.

14:28.034 --> 14:30.093
It seems your conversation is over.

14:31.504 --> 14:32.937
Yeah.

14:33.005 --> 14:34.700
I'll finish her.

14:34.774 --> 14:36.105
Please stand back.

14:52.992 --> 14:54.983
The Dragons of Heaven will perish.

14:57.496 --> 14:59.964
The future will be just as in the dreams...

15:00.032 --> 15:02.899
...and I will live on as a dreamseer.

15:11.577 --> 15:13.169
The future...

15:13.245 --> 15:15.236
The future is but one.

15:30.696 --> 15:34.291
I wish for the future to change...

15:34.366 --> 15:38.735
What meaning is there in my existence?

15:40.973 --> 15:42.497
Impossible...

15:51.417 --> 15:52.384
Sister...

15:54.720 --> 15:56.813
- Princess!
- P-Princess!

16:02.561 --> 16:04.153
W-What's going on?

16:04.230 --> 16:06.061
The spell servants are gone.

16:06.132 --> 16:09.124
And Yuzuriha's Barrier is gone, too.

16:09.201 --> 16:12.193
Kamui! Head over to Princess Hinoto's.

16:12.271 --> 16:13.898
I'll handle Yuzuriha!

16:13.973 --> 16:15.440
I'm trusting you!

16:21.914 --> 16:23.745
Kusanagi!

16:23.816 --> 16:25.477
W-Why?

16:25.551 --> 16:27.746
I'm a Dragon of Heaven!

16:31.123 --> 16:34.217
The Kamui of the Dragons of Earth told me...

16:34.293 --> 16:37.091
...that you would betray us someday.

16:37.163 --> 16:39.654
And he said when that happened...

16:41.000 --> 16:42.024
...to kill you.

16:43.536 --> 16:44.503
Kusanagi!

16:45.905 --> 16:47.270
W-What?

17:09.628 --> 17:11.220
Kusanagi!

17:11.297 --> 17:13.561
Kusanagi, hold on!

17:13.632 --> 17:15.293
Kusanagi!

17:15.401 --> 17:16.698
Kusanagi!

17:25.211 --> 17:26.576
I-It can't be...

17:32.484 --> 17:33.610
Kamui...

17:35.421 --> 17:37.582
Just as you suspect...

17:38.624 --> 17:41.616
...I am nothing but a foolish sinner.

17:42.962 --> 17:46.022
The sways in my emotions...

17:46.098 --> 17:50.626
...put everyone's destiny out of balance.

17:53.839 --> 17:57.502
I have no way to apologize for it.

17:58.611 --> 18:03.207
I wished for the future to change...

18:05.184 --> 18:07.709
That you would change it...

18:08.754 --> 18:10.278
But...

18:10.356 --> 18:13.291
The final moment is fast approaching...

18:13.359 --> 18:15.224
The final moment?

18:15.294 --> 18:17.524
With my death...

18:17.596 --> 18:21.259
...the power to seal the Divine Sword will be lost.

18:22.635 --> 18:24.728
If the seal is broken...

18:24.803 --> 18:28.330
...the power of the Dragon of Earth Kamui cannot be stopped.

18:30.075 --> 18:35.980
So you must get ahold of your Divine Sword without delay.

18:39.151 --> 18:41.278
However, Kamui...

18:41.353 --> 18:46.017
You have not awakened as the true Dragon of Heaven yet...

18:47.192 --> 18:51.686
You cannot unleash the powers of the Divine Sword yet.

18:53.599 --> 18:55.464
But still, I...

18:56.635 --> 18:58.603
...want to believe in you.

18:59.972 --> 19:02.372
Let me believe in you, Kamui...

19:18.557 --> 19:20.491
Sister, why...

19:21.627 --> 19:23.458
Why did you...

19:35.708 --> 19:39.644
The campus' psychic barrier will disappear with the princess.

19:39.712 --> 19:42.613
The seal on the Divine Sword will be broken, too.

19:42.681 --> 19:46.014
Kamui, we entrust you with the wish of the princess.

20:06.739 --> 20:07.763
Hinoto...

20:08.941 --> 20:12.069
Can I grieve after everything is over?

20:14.179 --> 20:15.339
For now...

20:15.414 --> 20:16.938
...sweet dreams.

20:41.673 --> 20:43.368
Kamui...

20:43.442 --> 20:46.843
...it appears the time has come for the final showdown.
